;; sukashi 透かし — crawl frontier (ADR-2606071600 R1). The "where to look" list for the
;; worldwide ad-supply-chain crawler (methods/crawl.py). Each entry names a REAL domain that
;; publishes a PUBLIC IAB file (ads.txt for publishers, sellers.json for exchanges/SSPs) by the
;; IAB Tech Lab spec. This is a bounded, representative seed of the frontier — the full worldwide
;; frontier is enumerated from public registries (IAB Tech Lab, Common Crawl host list) at the
;; G7 operator gate; this list lets the crawler run end-to-end without that enumeration.
;;
;; CONSTITUTIONAL: a frontier entry is "a domain whose ads.txt/sellers.json is worth observing",
;; NEVER an accusation (G4 — real firms carry no fraud signal; that is decided downstream, only on
;; CLEARLY-FICTIONAL synthesized entities). :sourcing :authoritative = it is a public fact that
;; these domains serve these public files; absence of a domain ≠ illegitimacy (G5).
;;
;; :role ∈ :publisher (serves /ads.txt) | :app-publisher (serves /app-ads.txt) | :exchange | :ssp
;;        (serve /sellers.json). All domains additionally have a public RDAP record.

